---
description: Use English only for this project. No Turkish or other languages in UI, copy, comments, or docs.
globs: "*.ts, *.tsx, *.js, *.jsx, *.md, *.json, *.prisma"
alwaysApply: true
---

This project uses **English only**.

- All user-facing text (labels, buttons, messages, placeholders, page titles) must be in English.
- Comments and documentation in code must be in English.
- Error messages and API response messages must be in English.
- Do not use Turkish or other languages unless explicitly required by a separate localization feature.
